{"id":"4f6ed68c536ba88e","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable.md","title":"两个对角值集合有效不可分","display":"ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable — 两个对角值集合有效不可分","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable","aliases":["20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable"],"display":"ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable — 两个对角值集合有效不可分","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.26；Exercise 2.4.17(ii)","source_printed_pages":[19,42],"source_pdf_pages":[55,78],"depends_on":["[[20-df-effective-inseparable]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable — 两个对角值集合有效不可分"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.26；Exercise 2.4.17(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span><span>42</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span><span>78</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50c256093c2a445f\" href=\"?note=50c256093c2a445f\" title=\"20-df-effective-inseparable\">20-df-effective-inseparable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=0\\}\">\\(A_0=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_1=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=1\\}\">\\(A_1=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50c256093c2a445f\" href=\"?note=50c256093c2a445f\" title=\"20-df-effective-inseparable\">20-df-effective-inseparable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A_0,A_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A_0,A_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两集合不交且 c.e.。以 e,j 为参数，由递归定理取得索引 n(e,j)：其程序在任意输入上等到 n 进入 W_e 或 W_j；前者先发生则输出 1，后者先发生则输出 0，同时出现时固定取前者。在 A₀⊆W_e、A₁⊆W_j 且两超集不交的 promise 下，n∈W_e 会推出 n∈A₁⊆W_j，n∈W_j 会推出 n∈A₀⊆W_e，均矛盾。故 p(〈e,j〉)=n(e,j) 是处处生成索引的生产函数，并可由单射参数编译取整体单射。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.26；Exercise 2.4.17(ii)；印刷页 19, 42；PDF 第 55, 78 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","